  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "#独库公路 #独库公路封路 #乔尔玛烈士陵园 #新疆 #中国基建",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 244.482993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "独库公路十月八日晚上，八点正式封路了，这条路，一年只开放四五个月。但为了这几个月，有人用了一辈子。上世纪七十年代，为了打通天山南北，数万名官兵开进了天山深处，五百六十一公里，二百八十多公里在海拔二千米以上，三分之一是悬崖绝壁五分之一。处于高山永动层，有一段六公里的悬崖，测绘人员根本上不去，图纸上只能画虚线，叫飞线施工的时候，战士们先打一个洞，铆一根钢钎，吊一根安全绳，把炮手从悬崖上缓缓放下。他们身背封攥，腰缠炸药包，腰在半空中打眼放炮图纸上的虚线就是这样，一点一点变成了路。整整十年，一百六十八名官兵再也没有走出来。最小的十八岁最大的五十七岁副营长姚虎城为给大部队清除雪仗，被雪崩吞没。指导员李善国带着战士清理十方，被泥石流埋进了土里。在这些名字背后，有一个故事，我每次讲都会停顿。一九八零年四月，大雪封山部队断粮，班长郑明书带着三名战士下山送信求救。四个人在零下几十度的暴风雪里迷了路，干粮吃完了，只剩最后一个馒头，谁也不肯吃。因为大家都清楚，谁吃了这个馒头，谁就有可能活着出去。班长郑明书做出了决定。我和副班长是共产党员，陈卫星是老兵，陈俊贵最小馒头给他陈俊贵，含着眼泪不肯吃。班长急了，下了命令，咽下馒头。几个小时后，班长郑林殊昏倒在雪地里，再也没有醒来。临终前，他拉着陈军贵的手说，你要是能活着出去去我湖北老家看看，我父母陈俊贵活了下来。他复原后，在老家有份安稳工作，直到看了电影天山行银幕上的画面，和当年雪山上的绝境几乎重合。他彻夜难眠，我这安稳至子，是战友用命换来的。他带着妻子回到天山为班长守墓，这一首就是四十多年。有人问他，一个馒头的恩情要守一辈子吗？七十多岁的陈俊贵回答，孩子，你无法体会到，在生死关头，那不是一个馒头，是生命。今天，这条路从国防命脉变成了中国最美公路。二零二五年通行期间，全县累计交通量近三百七十万辆次人员流动量七百零七点三万人次。沿线牧民开启了民宿小村庄，变成了打卡地，明年魁独库高速公路正在建设中。预计二零三二年建成后，天山将实现全年全天候通行。那条曾经一年只开五个月的路，将永远不再封路。你现在看到的每一帧风景都是他们用命换来的。如果你也被这条路打动，请为乔尔玛的一百六十八位战友点个赞，让更多人看到这条路不止美在风景。更美，在有人用命守过评论区，打一句，明年见，转发给那个想和你一起走毒库的人。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 2730,
      "text": "独库公路十月八日晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2810,
      "end_ms": 5370,
      "text": "八点正式封路了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6290,
      "end_ms": 6990,
      "text": "这条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7230,
      "end_ms": 9670,
      "text": "一年只开放四五个月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10550,
      "end_ms": 11770,
      "text": "但为了这几个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12010,
      "end_ms": 13330,
      "text": "有人用了一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14410,
      "end_ms": 15970,
      "text": "上世纪七十年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16350,
      "end_ms": 18110,
      "text": "为了打通天山南北，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18350,
      "end_ms": 21050,
      "text": "数万名官兵开进了天山深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21850,
      "end_ms": 23370,
      "text": "五百六十一公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23630,
      "end_ms": 27270,
      "text": "二百八十多公里在海拔二千米以上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27610,
      "end_ms": 31420,
      "text": "三分之一是悬崖绝壁五分之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31440,
      "end_ms": 33160,
      "text": "处于高山永动层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33940,
      "end_ms": 36280,
      "text": "有一段六公里的悬崖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00015",
      "start_ms": 36700,
      "end_ms": 38920,
      "text": "测绘人员根本上不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00016",
      "start_ms": 39000,
      "end_ms": 40660,
      "text": "图纸上只能画虚线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00017",
      "start_ms": 40880,
      "end_ms": 43180,
      "text": "叫飞线施工的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00018",
      "start_ms": 43320,
      "end_ms": 44880,
      "text": "战士们先打一个洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00019",
      "start_ms": 45160,
      "end_ms": 46300,
      "text": "铆一根钢钎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00020",
      "start_ms": 46600,
      "end_ms": 47920,
      "text": "吊一根安全绳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00021",
      "start_ms": 48400,
      "end_ms": 51340,
      "text": "把炮手从悬崖上缓缓放下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00022",
      "start_ms": 51880,
      "end_ms": 53380,
      "text": "他们身背封攥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00023",
      "start_ms": 53800,
      "end_ms": 55120,
      "text": "腰缠炸药包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00024",
      "start_ms": 55460,
      "end_ms": 60450,
      "text": "腰在半空中打眼放炮图纸上的虚线就是这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00025",
      "start_ms": 60470,
      "end_ms": 62135,
      "text": "一点一点变成了路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00026",
      "start_ms": 63090,
      "end_ms": 64235,
      "text": "整整十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00027",
      "start_ms": 64620,
      "end_ms": 67945,
      "text": "一百六十八名官兵再也没有走出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00028",
      "start_ms": 68490,
      "end_ms": 76810,
      "text": "最小的十八岁最大的五十七岁副营长姚虎城为给大部队清除雪仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00029",
      "start_ms": 76830,
      "end_ms": 78255,
      "text": "被雪崩吞没。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00030",
      "start_ms": 78770,
      "end_ms": 82595,
      "text": "指导员李善国带着战士清理十方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00031",
      "start_ms": 83040,
      "end_ms": 85715,
      "text": "被泥石流埋进了土里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00032",
      "start_ms": 86620,
      "end_ms": 87900,
      "text": "在这些名字背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00033",
      "start_ms": 88160,
      "end_ms": 89165,
      "text": "有一个故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00034",
      "start_ms": 89570,
      "end_ms": 91365,
      "text": "我每次讲都会停顿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00035",
      "start_ms": 91920,
      "end_ms": 93300,
      "text": "一九八零年四月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00036",
      "start_ms": 93420,
      "end_ms": 95535,
      "text": "大雪封山部队断粮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00037",
      "start_ms": 96680,
      "end_ms": 101575,
      "text": "班长郑明书带着三名战士下山送信求救。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00038",
      "start_ms": 102480,
      "end_ms": 105695,
      "text": "四个人在零下几十度的暴风雪里迷了路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00039",
      "start_ms": 106130,
      "end_ms": 107125,
      "text": "干粮吃完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00040",
      "start_ms": 107370,
      "end_ms": 108790,
      "text": "只剩最后一个馒头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00041",
      "start_ms": 108990,
      "end_ms": 109870,
      "text": "谁也不肯吃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00042",
      "start_ms": 110170,
      "end_ms": 111290,
      "text": "因为大家都清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00043",
      "start_ms": 111310,
      "end_ms": 112350,
      "text": "谁吃了这个馒头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00044",
      "start_ms": 112550,
      "end_ms": 114070,
      "text": "谁就有可能活着出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00045",
      "start_ms": 114190,
      "end_ms": 116375,
      "text": "班长郑明书做出了决定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00046",
      "start_ms": 116780,
      "end_ms": 118825,
      "text": "我和副班长是共产党员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00047",
      "start_ms": 119210,
      "end_ms": 120410,
      "text": "陈卫星是老兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00048",
      "start_ms": 120790,
      "end_ms": 124720,
      "text": "陈俊贵最小馒头给他陈俊贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00049",
      "start_ms": 124720,
      "end_ms": 126005,
      "text": "含着眼泪不肯吃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00050",
      "start_ms": 126900,
      "end_ms": 127845,
      "text": "班长急了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00051",
      "start_ms": 128210,
      "end_ms": 128965,
      "text": "下了命令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00052",
      "start_ms": 129310,
      "end_ms": 130210,
      "text": "咽下馒头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00053",
      "start_ms": 130250,
      "end_ms": 131090,
      "text": "几个小时后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00054",
      "start_ms": 131490,
      "end_ms": 134405,
      "text": "班长郑林殊昏倒在雪地里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00055",
      "start_ms": 134770,
      "end_ms": 135785,
      "text": "再也没有醒来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00056",
      "start_ms": 136700,
      "end_ms": 137300,
      "text": "临终前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00057",
      "start_ms": 137300,
      "end_ms": 138660,
      "text": "他拉着陈军贵的手说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00058",
      "start_ms": 139060,
      "end_ms": 142810,
      "text": "你要是能活着出去去我湖北老家看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00059",
      "start_ms": 142810,
      "end_ms": 144935,
      "text": "我父母陈俊贵活了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00060",
      "start_ms": 145430,
      "end_ms": 146210,
      "text": "他复原后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00061",
      "start_ms": 146490,
      "end_ms": 148210,
      "text": "在老家有份安稳工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00062",
      "start_ms": 148350,
      "end_ms": 152285,
      "text": "直到看了电影天山行银幕上的画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00063",
      "start_ms": 152630,
      "end_ms": 155975,
      "text": "和当年雪山上的绝境几乎重合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00064",
      "start_ms": 156590,
      "end_ms": 157710,
      "text": "他彻夜难眠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00065",
      "start_ms": 157770,
      "end_ms": 158865,
      "text": "我这安稳至子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00066",
      "start_ms": 159250,
      "end_ms": 161235,
      "text": "是战友用命换来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00067",
      "start_ms": 161840,
      "end_ms": 165545,
      "text": "他带着妻子回到天山为班长守墓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00068",
      "start_ms": 165960,
      "end_ms": 168555,
      "text": "这一首就是四十多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00069",
      "start_ms": 169660,
      "end_ms": 170485,
      "text": "有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00070",
      "start_ms": 171660,
      "end_ms": 174535,
      "text": "一个馒头的恩情要守一辈子吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00071",
      "start_ms": 175000,
      "end_ms": 177015,
      "text": "七十多岁的陈俊贵回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00072",
      "start_ms": 177400,
      "end_ms": 177905,
      "text": "孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00073",
      "start_ms": 178240,
      "end_ms": 179500,
      "text": "你无法体会到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00074",
      "start_ms": 179620,
      "end_ms": 180985,
      "text": "在生死关头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00075",
      "start_ms": 181330,
      "end_ms": 182590,
      "text": "那不是一个馒头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00076",
      "start_ms": 182770,
      "end_ms": 183465,
      "text": "是生命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00077",
      "start_ms": 184060,
      "end_ms": 184500,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00078",
      "start_ms": 184660,
      "end_ms": 189325,
      "text": "这条路从国防命脉变成了中国最美公路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00079",
      "start_ms": 190060,
      "end_ms": 191840,
      "text": "二零二五年通行期间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00080",
      "start_ms": 192160,
      "end_ms": 199845,
      "text": "全县累计交通量近三百七十万辆次人员流动量七百零七点三万人次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00081",
      "start_ms": 200340,
      "end_ms": 203680,
      "text": "沿线牧民开启了民宿小村庄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00082",
      "start_ms": 203720,
      "end_ms": 204915,
      "text": "变成了打卡地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00083",
      "start_ms": 205430,
      "end_ms": 208665,
      "text": "明年魁独库高速公路正在建设中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00084",
      "start_ms": 208990,
      "end_ms": 211225,
      "text": "预计二零三二年建成后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00085",
      "start_ms": 211550,
      "end_ms": 215105,
      "text": "天山将实现全年全天候通行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00086",
      "start_ms": 215690,
      "end_ms": 218255,
      "text": "那条曾经一年只开五个月的路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00087",
      "start_ms": 219010,
      "end_ms": 220630,
      "text": "将永远不再封路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00088",
      "start_ms": 220690,
      "end_ms": 225615,
      "text": "你现在看到的每一帧风景都是他们用命换来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00089",
      "start_ms": 226260,
      "end_ms": 227960,
      "text": "如果你也被这条路打动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00090",
      "start_ms": 228260,
      "end_ms": 231915,
      "text": "请为乔尔玛的一百六十八位战友点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00091",
      "start_ms": 232420,
      "end_ms": 236115,
      "text": "让更多人看到这条路不止美在风景。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00092",
      "start_ms": 236640,
      "end_ms": 236980,
      "text": "更美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00093",
      "start_ms": 236980,
      "end_ms": 239340,
      "text": "在有人用命守过评论区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00094",
      "start_ms": 239340,
      "end_ms": 239820,
      "text": "打一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00095",
      "start_ms": 239820,
      "end_ms": 240495,
      "text": "明年见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dfbf7a88a8e72055_s00096",
      "start_ms": 240850,
      "end_ms": 244385,
      "text": "转发给那个想和你一起走毒库的人。"
    }
  ],
